	(descr "TO-92 in line (KiCad TO-92_Inline), centred on the middle lead, the flat face at +y (silk bar). Pads numbered BY FUNCTION for MPSA42's E-B-C lead order: pad 2 emitter (square), pad 1 base (middle), pad 3 collector - the same numbers as the SOT-23 MMBTA42, so one symbol serves both builds. Mounted on the BACK: geometry mirrored in X from the KiCad library original, graphics on B.* layers. Pre-rotated 270 deg counter-clockwise (front view), per this repo's no-rotation-token convention.")
